```yaml
{{ .Files.Get "values-minimal.yaml" }}
```

To extract the complete default values from the packaged chart:

```bash
helm show values <repo-name>/{{ .Name }} > values-full.yaml
```

## Installation

1. Create or select a namespace:
```bash
kubectl create namespace <namespace>
```

2. Review and adjust your values file (minimal or full).

3. Install or upgrade:
```bash
helm upgrade --install x9-qrcode <repo-name>/{{ .Name }} \
  --namespace <namespace> \
  --values values.yaml
```

4. Render manifests locally for validation:
```bash
helm template x9-qrcode <repo-name>/{{ .Name }} --values values.yaml
```

## Environment Promotion Example

```bash
ENV=x9-dev
helm upgrade --install -n ${ENV} -f chart/values.yaml --values values/${ENV}/values.yaml x9-qrcode chart/
```

Dry run:

```bash
ENV=x9-dev
helm upgrade --dry-run -n ${ENV} -f chart/values.yaml --values values/${ENV}/values.yaml x9-qrcode chart/
```

